abstract: "AsiBackbone 3.2.2 is a backward-compatible maintenance patch for the stable 3.2.x line. It refreshes approved .NET dependencies and SHA-pinned GitHub Actions/security tooling, and normalizes repository metadata without changing package IDs, public namespaces, public APIs, runtime governance behavior, the net10.0 target, or AssemblyVersion 3.0.0.0."
